For William, saw a figure in the room,

00:32:48.530 --> 00:32:50.890
Most people
When awake,

00:32:50.890 --> 00:32:52.920
but in sleep paralysis.

00:32:52.920 --> 00:32:57.400
Most people sense the
presence of a figure.

00:32:57.400 --> 00:33:01.260
Like what happens is, is
you, your mind wakes up,

00:33:01.260 --> 00:33:02.670
