00:33:21.670 --> 00:33:24.620
And so you really, so
you're faced with a choice.

00:33:24.620 --> 00:33:25.453
Now you could be like,

00:33:25.453 --> 00:33:27.600
I'm just going to lay
here and go back to sleep.

00:33:27.600 --> 00:33:30.110
But for me, I could never do that.

00:33:30.110 --> 00:33:32.957
