to getting out of it.

00:33:32.957 --> 00:33:35.810
And so I would like start
trying to find a limb to move.

00:33:35.810 --> 00:33:37.580
And it would be like,

00:33:37.580 --> 00:33:39.779
and eventually you go like .

00:33:39.779 --> 00:33:40.612
And then you get out of it.

00:33:40.612 --> 00:33:41.781
What?

00:33:41.781 --> 00:33:42.953
That would happen to me
pretty often growing up.

00:33:42.953 --> 00:33:45.250
It's like breaking out
