I never saw the dark figure.

00:34:08.640 --> 00:34:10.510
Sleep paralysis.

00:34:10.510 --> 00:34:11.813
Common figures.

00:34:15.570 --> 00:34:17.590
People who experienced sleep
paralysis have essentially

00:34:17.590 --> 00:34:19.460
