00:34:19.460 --> 00:34:21.080
It's an incredibly common sleep problem.

00:34:21.080 --> 00:34:23.993
An estimated 8% of people
who experience it regularly.

00:34:25.978 --> 00:34:29.163
Ever wake up frozen in
