00:34:33.531 --> 00:34:35.220
Yeah.

00:34:35.220 --> 00:34:36.270
Okay, here it is.

00:34:36.270 --> 00:34:38.240
Imagine you're asleep and
you slowly open your eyes.

00:34:38.240 --> 00:34:42.623
This is KQED.org/science.

00:34:43.660 --> 00:34:44.560
Your body won't move.

