01:15:05.750 --> 01:15:07.680
Jessie was like, "let's
watch Hocus Pocus."

01:15:07.680 --> 01:15:08.513
I've never seen it.

01:15:08.513 --> 01:15:09.430
And you know-

01:15:09.430 --> 01:15:10.390
We were too old for it.

01:15:10.390 --> 01:15:11.370
You gotta know what you're getting into.

01:15:11.370 --> 01:15:14.300
You're getting into a 1993 Disney movie

01:15:14.300 --> 01:15:17.320
starring Bette Midler and Sarah
Jessica Parker as witches.

01:15:17.320 --> 01:15:19.530
And the, I can't remember
the third actor's name,

01:15:19.530 --> 01:15:23.120
