01:15:23.120 --> 01:15:24.573
There's musical numbers.

01:15:25.800 --> 01:15:30.800
You're kind of laughing at
the nineties as you enjoy it,

01:15:30.890 --> 01:15:35.437
but you have to go into it
with that level of expectation

01:15:35.437 --> 01:15:37.890
that you're laughing at them.

01:15:37.890 --> 01:15:39.240
Did Shepherd like it?

01:15:39.240 --> 01:15:40.380
Yeah.
He did?

01:15:40.380 --> 01:15:41.213
Yeah.

01:15:41.213 --> 01:15:43.820
But he, he liked it on a cynical level.

01:15:43.820 --> 01:15:45.560
We watch those kinds of like,

01:15:45.560 --> 01:15:47.540
